The timetable (GTFS) comes from the open data of Nantes Métropole
(https://data.nantesmetropole.fr), and the real-time trip updates and service
alerts (GTFS-RT) of Naolib, the public transport of Nantes Métropole, are
read through the national access point
https://transport.data.gouv.fr/datasets/reseau-de-transports-collectifs-naolib,
under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Source: Naolib, Nantes
Métropole. The widgets show the source (Naolib) and the time of each reading.
The files under test/fixtures are extracts of these data, kept under the same
licence.

This community integration is not affiliated with, endorsed or sponsored by
Naolib, Semitan or Nantes Métropole.
